After such optimism things can only go wrong. And they did.

Entering Astral Plane I had HP of over 400 and AC -44. No ring of
conflict, so I got myself a guardian angel. Famine on the right, so I
went there first (never have been killed by Famine). No problems,
except that the altar was not the right one. But I didn't really expect
to find it at the first try anyways. So I started to cut myself through
the mob, I didn't even bother to read all the messages. I'm embarrased
to say I kept hitting Esc between my moves so that those messages
wouldn't even show. What can I say, I had my guardian angel besides me,
and I was mostly surrounded by insects so I felt safe, it was late and
I was tired, so I just wanted to ascend quickly so I could hit the
sack. But suddenly, after hitting Esc, my heart stopped: Screen went
blank, only one short line of text gleefully staring at me, saying:

Hit <Enter> to end.

Say what?

Logfile shows:

3.4.3 1671704 7 -5 46 -2 439 2 20060813 20060809 1 Wiz Elf Mal Cha
Welho,killed by an Angel of Anhur (with the Amulet)

I have no idea what happened. I thought Angel of Anhur was supposed to
be on *my* side. I had no conflict. I also wasn't wearing ring of free
action, so I can only imagine being paralyzed, otherwise I couldn't
have lost my 400+ hp's in a single turn! I also thought I had "oLS, but
apparently that had been used up (had a spare in my bag, though).
Obviously I wasn't paying enough attention, so I could have been low on
hp's without knowing. But anyways my hp's were almost full just a few
turns before when I was at the wrong altar.

What bugs me most is that I didn't learn anything from this YASD, so I
might end up dying the same way next time I get to Astral plane.

So my next challenge was to learn to patch and compile the game.
